    },
    {
        "text": "Don't push me, or it won't be my shield against your chin.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_248",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "*Cough*, *cough* *cough*... If you're going to draw your sword, you'll be attacking a colleague...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Adjutant Hill"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_248",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Heh. Colleague?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_229_1#7",
        "name2": "avg_npc_248",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "At what point, since the moment we entered County Hillock, have you ever treated us as colleagues?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Answer me!!!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_229_1#7",
        "name2": "avg_npc_248",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hff\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Adjutant Hill"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even supposing... you... cut my throat here... you can't alter... the Colonel's decision...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Adjutant Hill"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_248",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Is that so?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "text": "You've never heard the degree of what the Tempest Platoon's soldiers can do, have you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "text": "How many did Triangle cost you? Half your own company?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's just me alone here. But I guarantee you, you won't want to know how long it takes me to put you all to rights.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_241"
    },
    {
        "text": "L\u2014Lay down your weapons!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Victorian Soldier"
    },
    {
        "text": "Or else, w... we'll kill her on the spot!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Victorian Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_229_1#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_241",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...Cello.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_241",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_241"
    },
    {
        "text": "I mean it! Make one move, and my crossbow's shooting straight through her neck!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Victorian Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_229_1#7",
        "name2": "avg_npc_241",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "............",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_241",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "text": "You win.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
