    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_245_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Got the data all nice and pretty?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Outcast"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_245_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, Lass, it's all in here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Operator Fred"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_245_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Wonderful.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Outcast"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_245_1#1",
        "name2": "char_013_riop",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I see Oliver's all done with the comms too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Outcast"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_245_1#1",
        "name2": "char_013_riop",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Collaborating businesses have received notice. As per the agreement clauses, they can either seek an office in another city nearby, or terminate the contract.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Operator Oliver"
    },
    {
        "text": "*Sigh*. Looking at it, these aren't losses for us to sneeze at.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Operator Oliver"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_245_1#2",
        "name2": "char_013_riop",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Rhodes Island isn't the only company taking a hit in the chaos of war.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Outcast"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_245_1#2",
        "name2": "char_013_riop",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "True, no way around that. I just look at the chairs and tables in here and there's a twinge in my heart. This place of ours was still empty, back when I first came to County Hillock.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Operator Oliver"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_245_1#1",
        "name2": "char_013_riop",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "A little early for separation anxiety, Oliver. How do you know we won't be right back, huh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Outcast"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_245_1#1",
        "name2": "char_013_riop",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You're right. *Sigh*. I hope this city can return to the old peaceful everydays soon enough.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Operator Oliver"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_089"
    },
    {
        "text": "Storehouse medications, inventory finished.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Operator Shredder"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_245_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I need you to ration out these meds. Each one of you needs to bring enough emergency medication, make sure everyone makes it smoothly to the closest branch office.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Outcast"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_089",
        "name2": "char_013_riop",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "There's still a lot left over, sharing like that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Operator Shredder"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_089",
        "name2": "char_013_riop",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "There'll be some pressure if we take it all. We don't have that many hands, after all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Operator Oliver"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_245_1#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_089",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Shredder's quiet as ever, but I can tell, you have your own ideas.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Outcast"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_245_1#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_089",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "The people in the city... They need medicines.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Operator Shredder"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_245_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_089",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Turns out I think so too. If this war scales up, everything's gonna be in short supply, especially Oripathy painkillers and suppressants that need to be taken long-term.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Outcast"
    },
    {
        "text": "You must have a list of hospitals in the area?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Outcast"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_245_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_089",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Already sorted.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Operator Shredder"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_245_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_089",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Think of a way to get it to them. No matter who these organizations serve, get as much as you can to all of them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Outcast"
    },
    {
        "text": "And don't forget the little alley clinics. Plenty of them out there without signs, but a lot of our friends around here rely on them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Outcast"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_245_1#1",
        "name2": "char_013_riop",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Lass, is this really proper? We never bypass local healthcare, directly providing medical organizations and individuals with pharmaceuticals.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Operator Oliver"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_245_1#1",
        "name2": "char_013_riop",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Desperate times call for desperate measures. And it's not like a hospital's gonna refuse an 'anonymous donation' from concerned citizens, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Outcast"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_245_1#1",
        "name2": "char_013_riop",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "True! So you got it all figured out, eh. But then, who'll take charge of sending it? The people around all know we're Rhodes Islanders.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Operator Oliver"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_479_sleach_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_245_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I will... I can help Shredder parcel the medicine, and then I'll deliver it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Janie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_479_sleach_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_245_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Jane, you all better?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Outcast"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_479_sleach_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_245_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "My wounds aren't bleeding anymore.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Janie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_479_sleach_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_245_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You know I'm not asking about the wounds.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Outcast"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_479_sleach_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_245_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I didn't want to be tucked alone in a corner crying while you were all bustling about.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Janie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_479_sleach_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_245_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm glad you can help, but we've got a lot of meds here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Outcast"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_479_sleach_1#7$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_245_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Please, trust a Vouivre's stamina.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Janie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_479_sleach_1#7$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_245_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I just don't want Rhodes Island work getting in the way of your own plans.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Outcast"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_479_sleach_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_245_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "It's alright. From here to the zone of battle, there just so happens to be plenty of hospitals and clinics along the way.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Janie"
    },
    {
        "text": "Once I'm done delivering, I'll rejoin you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Janie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
