    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Just a little left. We'll be done with wrapping in no time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Janie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_245_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then it's about time we got on our way.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Outcast"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "text": "As Outcast speaks, she draws a revolver from the holster at her side."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_245_1#1",
        "name2": "char_013_riop",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Whoa. That's your gun?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Operator Oliver"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_245_1#6",
        "name2": "char_013_riop",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "That it is.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Outcast"
    },
    {
        "text": "For a Sankta, pre-op prep's only complete once your gun's loaded.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Outcast"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_245_1#6",
        "name2": "char_013_riop",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "It doesn't look like your chamber's full.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Operator Oliver"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_245_1#1",
        "name2": "char_013_riop",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Under normal circumstances, five rounds is enough to do the trick.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Outcast"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_245_1#1",
        "name2": "char_013_riop",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "When I was back at the landship and ate with Barty's group, I heard a lot of stories from the field about you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Operator Oliver"
    },
    {
        "text": "You once took down three Columbian bandits with a single bullet, and used three to scatter a whole mercenary team.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Operator Oliver"
    },
    {
        "text": "If I had to guess, there wouldn't be an enemy out there worth six straight shots?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Operator Oliver"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_245_1#1",
        "name2": "char_013_riop",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Can't say for sure. After all, there's always a bigger beast.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Outcast"
    },
    {
        "text": "But I made a promise to someone that I'd never fire a sixth round lightly\u2014because we made a bet.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Outcast"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_479_sleach_1#4$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_245_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I can't help but be curious. What kind of bet would make someone like you change up how you work?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Janie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_479_sleach_1#4$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_245_1#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "That's a long story.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Outcast"
    },
    {
        "text": "The short version is that friend of mine tried every way under the sun to show me an easy retirement.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Outcast"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_479_sleach_1#4$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_245_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "And I always had a feeling that even if I retired for real, someone like me just couldn't live peaceful.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Outcast"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_479_sleach_1#4$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_245_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Like right now?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Janie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_479_sleach_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_245_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I never imagined County Hillock could turn so restless. It was just a day or two ago, we were all huddled together playing cards and drinking tea...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Janie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_479_sleach_1#4$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_245_1#6",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "A lot of times, a situation's like the color of the sky, shifting on and on.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Outcast"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_479_sleach_1#4$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_245_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "If it's up to me, I'd sure like this retreat operation to go nice and quiet-like. Best case scenario, I don't even need to fire one round.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Outcast"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_089"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Lass, it's all ready.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Operator Shredder"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_479_sleach_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Friends, it's time to say goodbye.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Janie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_013_riop"
    },
    {
        "text": "Janie...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Operator Oliver"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_479_sleach_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You don't need to be so sad, Uncle Oliver. I trust in what Outcast says\u2014we can surely see each other again!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Janie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_089"
    },
    {
        "text": "Jane, be careful.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Operator Shredder"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_479_sleach_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I will, Shredder. All of you too, be sure to take care of yourselves.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Janie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "ystrength": 10,
        "vibrato": 10,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_explo_n",
        "volume": 0.2
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_479_sleach_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh... did I hear thunder?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Janie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_013_riop"
    },
    {
        "text": "...It'll be raining soon enough.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Operator Shredder"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_245_1#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "No. Something's not right about that sound. Jane, stay inside for now!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Outcast"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
