    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Mr. Chef, Mr. Chef, are you here?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "avg_npc_242",
        "fadetime": 1.5,
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Agh! Yes, I'm here, I'm here! Stop it with the banging! There's too much lampblack on our office door. Can't stand up to knocks.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Chef MacMartin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$dooropenquite"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$rungeneral"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#7",
        "name2": "avg_npc_242",
        "fadetime": 1.5,
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Okay, good, you're still here... here's the thing, I need a Messenger, we've got important information that needs sendin' out!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#7",
        "name2": "avg_npc_242",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah, I understand. Fancy that, I've got something to give to you too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Chef MacMartin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_242",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Eh? What's this? A piece of... paper?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_242",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "It's a list of stationed officers\u2014the one named Louis Kelly, he just handed it to me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Chef MacMartin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_242",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Captain Kelly? How'd he get in touch with you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_242",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Relax, he's got no clue who I am. It was only 'cause I was the last person he ran into.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Chef MacMartin"
    },
    {
        "text": "I was going to go poking around for the latest. Still remember my actual job, after all... Didn't imagine I'd run into the troops arresting him!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Chef MacMartin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_242",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Arrestin'... him? You mean, Captain Kelly's been arrested by his own?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_242",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "They said he was harboring Oripathics! But that can't be right. His son passed from Oripathy a few months ago, the whole city knows that. The first thing he did was report the news his son'd gotten ill!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Chef MacMartin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#6",
        "name2": "avg_npc_242",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "These people... usin' such a tragic illness as an excuse? That's beyond shameless!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#6",
        "name2": "avg_npc_242",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Not just once or twice, either. For people wanting to use any form of discrimination as a front, it's true, Oripathy is an especially good pretense.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Chef MacMartin"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just take this time. The troops are weeding out any inside people born Taran.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Chef MacMartin"
    },
    {
        "text": "Officers or soldiers, so long as they were kindred with Tarans in some way, were stripped overnight of any right to act freely.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Chef MacMartin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#6",
        "name2": "avg_npc_242",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Clearin' out the barracks' Tarans? In wartime, pressed for people? I've got an awful feelin' about this already.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#6",
        "name2": "avg_npc_242",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "So, Captain Kelly slipped me this like his life depended on it, wanted me to give it to 'the soldier not from this barracks who's constantly been hanging around here as of late'\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Chef MacMartin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#6",
        "name2": "avg_npc_242",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mr. Chef, this is proof the barracks are makin' illegal Originium weapons!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#6",
        "name2": "avg_npc_242",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What?! Hamilton's lost his mind!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Chef MacMartin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#6",
        "name2": "avg_npc_242",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I want you to find a trustworthy Messenger, give 'em this paper and our report about the spectre force both, to be treated as vital intelligence, and taken out of County Hillock straight away!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is the Captain's endeavor in his final moment! We cannot waste it!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#6",
        "name2": "avg_npc_242",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Can't do that. This information's too important, and we can't rely on a civilian Messenger. How about this instead, Miss\u2014I'll make this trip myself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Chef MacMartin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_242",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Mr. Chef, you were a Messenger too?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_242",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't forget, passing on information's part of us lamplighters' profession too. Ah, finally, I can take on a decent assignment at long last. Excitement's got my hands and legs shaking.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Messenger MacMartin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_242",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait, hold on, there's some sound outside...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_242",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "It's lightning, isn't it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Messenger MacMartin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#7",
        "name2": "avg_npc_242",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm feelin' doubtful about that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#7",
        "name2": "avg_npc_242",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "It's fine, I've been here in County Hillock how many years now. The weather changes when it wants to. Used to it at this point.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Messenger MacMartin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#7",
        "name2": "avg_npc_242",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "A little lightning and rain can't hold me back! I'm off!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Messenger MacMartin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
